ygoddess_01_12"},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_11","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_11","text":"Absolutely. Hot and sultry summer.","jump":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_17"},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_12","text":"My thoughts exactly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_13","text":"Wearing a swimsuit","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_14","text":"keeps you nice and cool.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_15","text":"I wouldn't know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_16","text":"Ha! I suppose not.","jump":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_17","text":"Oh, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_18","text":"You think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_19","text":"That certainly wasn't the reaction I expected.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_20","text":"Having said that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_21","text":"knowing that I can inspire","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_22","text":"such a reaction in you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_23","text":"makes me pretty happy, hehe!","jump":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_24","text":"I was worried","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_25","text":"you wouldn't be a fan.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_26","text":"I'm glad","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_27","text":"you're into it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_28","text":"I would have liked it no matter what kind of swimsuit you were wearing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_29","text":"Wow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_30","text":"That's so nice of you to say!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_31","text":"In that case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_32","text":"I'll have to try on some different looks in the future.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_33","text":"For example?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_34","text":"Sorry,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_35","text":"but I'll have to keep the details a secret.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_36","text":"You'll just have to wait and see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_37","text":"For the time being, would you like to come to see me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_38","text":"so you can appreciate this swimsuit in person?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_39","text":"Are you asking me to go for a swim?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_40","text":"That'd be nice too, but","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_41","text":"I was thinking more along the lines of a traditional date.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_42","text":"Oh, and I can also give you your summer physical!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_43","text":"Er... I don't know about that...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_44","text":"You don't want to come to see me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_45","text":"Don't tell me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_46","text":"this swimsuit has already lost its allure?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_47","text":"... I'll be right over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_48","text":"Okay","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mary_baygoddess_01_49","text":"I will be waiting!","jump":null}],"chat":true}